     1661         undo, return error return-value .
     1662       end.
     1663       define buffer buf_lock_gdsrengc_batchprocess for ub.batchprocess .
     1664       run gbl/lockrngd.p
     1665         (input  'grgc':U
     1666         ,input  'disable':U
